    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d317">

                <pb facs="0495" n="455" xml:id="pg455"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Adams.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1525.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-08-25"><hi rendition="#italic">
                                August</hi> 25, 1865</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Your despatch, No. 1031, of the 10th of
                    August, relative to the depredations committed by the Sea King in the sea of
                    Okhotsk, has been received. No representations and no farther information upon
                    the subject have been communicated to this department.</p>
                <p>You are at liberty to exercise your own discretion as to the expediency of
                    postponing action in the matter.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Francis Adams,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
